            <p rend="justify">"Eternal Father, Strong to Save"</p>
            <p rend="justify">a.k.a., "Navy Hymn"</p>
            <p rend="justify">Composer: John Bacchus Dykes (1823-1876)</p>
            <p rend="justify">Arranger: Rick Davis</p>
            <p rend="justify">This is more commonly known as the "Navy Hymn." If you've seen the movie Titanic, this is the hymn that the upper-class people are singing in the chapel.</p>
